# Publish immediately

After any change, commit and push to `origin` `main` in the same turn. Do not wait to be asked. Do not ask permission. Do not offer to publish later.

- Follow the existing git commit protocol (status, diff, log, HEREDOC message, no force, no hook skips).
- Push with `git -c credential.helper=osxkeychain push origin HEAD` so Vercel auto-deploys.
- Return the GitHub repo and live URL: https://stokedcoffee.vercel.app
- Skip only secrets (`.env`, credentials) and files the user said not to ship.
- If the working tree is already clean and `main` is synced with origin, say that. Do not ask what to do next.
